<v Cole Lindbergh>So--
<v Cole Lindbergh>所以……

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.120
<v Man>A banana.
<v Man>香蕉。

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:12.930
<v Cole Lindbergh>--is that--
<v Cole Lindbergh>……这是……

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.180
<v Ira Glass>You made the costume?
<v Ira Glass>你做的这套衣服？

