<v Haley>No, I've had this fabric. So this is the head hole, the arms hole. And it's going to look like the bananas in Lion's Den.
<v Haley>没有，我有这块布。所以这是头部开孔，这是手臂开孔。看起来会像“狮穴”里的香蕉。

