<v Cole Lindbergh>I like it. That is more than exciting.
<v Cole Lindbergh>我喜欢。那可不仅仅是让人兴奋。

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:46.320
<v Haley>People are going to be stopping, taking pictures. Oh, maybe I'll win one, too.
<v Haley>人们会停下脚步，拍照。哦，也许我也能赢一个。

00:16:46.320 --> 00:17:08.610
<v Ira Glass>Meanwhile, the guys in Games IV were doing great in Sweet 16. All their games had survived the first round. Games I was eliminated completely in the first round of Sweet 16. As for Games II, Max and Okson are pulling a double shift, hoping to break the record for how much has ever been made-- ever-- in their two games. Their not-so-secret strategy?
<v Ira Glass>与此同时，“游戏IV”组在“甜蜜16强”里表现出色。他们所有的游戏都在第一轮中幸存了下来。“游戏I”在“甜蜜16强”第一轮中全军覆没。至于“游戏II”，马克斯和奥克森正在加倍轮班，希望打破他们两个游戏有史以来最高的营收记录。他们那并非那么保密的策略？

